          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A surge in naval and paramilitary activity raises perceived geopolitical and shipping risk, prompting portfolio rebalancing, reduced new investment commitments and shorter-term capital withdrawals from the corridor and adjacent markets." />
