          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A surge in military and paramilitary activity and incidents around Hormuz provokes policy and enforcement responses in Washington (and allied capitals) that expand the scope and strictness of export controls on dual‑use and advanced technologies to China on national‑security grounds." />
