          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A demonstrably looser monetary policy stance (lower policy rates and easing bias) raises risk appetite and lowers discount-rate sensitivity for energy sector equities, lifting aggregate investor sentiment toward the sector within monetary transmission timelines." />
