          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sharp depreciation of importers' currencies (changes in exchange_rate_level) can impair buyers' ability to settle dollar invoices on time, producing payment delays and contractual shipment hold-ups that raise market expectations of Strait transit disruptions." />
